","other_name_zh":"推测执行","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"speculative-execution","other_summary":"处理器先按预测执行后续指令、猜错再回滚的硬件优化技术。","rationale":"都先用便宜的猜测提前做后续工作、再由权威结果验证，猜错则丢弃，原论文直接借用了推测执行的概念。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Fast Inference from Transformers via Speculative Decoding","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.17192"}],"type":"analogous_to","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-10-21T07:49:49.124827+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5eq05r9bzqpqj6m","other_id":"n_01m5eq05hrrhc8jecf","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"EAGLE","other_name_zh":null,"other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"eagle","other_summary":"在特征层面而非词元层面做自回归草稿的推测采样方法。","rationale":"在特征层面自回归地生成草稿，提高推测采样的接受率。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"EAGLE: Speculative Sampling Requires Rethinking Feature Uncertainty","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.15077"}],"type":"builds_on","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.9,"created_at":"2026-10-21T07:49:49.124827+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5eq05r79x3qkhkr","other_id":"n_01m5eq05hrc3dr1zjw","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Medusa","other_name_zh":null,"other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"medusa","other_summary":"在模型上加多个解码头同时预测后续多个词元、无需独立草稿模型的加速方法。","rationale":"以多解码头替代独立草稿模型实现推测式并行解码。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Medusa: Simple LLM Inference Acceleration Framework with Multiple Decoding Heads","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.10774"}],"type":"builds_on","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null}],"sources":[{"field":null,"published_at":"2022-11-30","publisher":"arXiv","quote":null,"title":"Fast Inference from Transformers via Speculative Decoding","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.17192"}],"topics":[{"id":"n_01m5eh84sra3k1vqv7","name":"Efficient Inference and Serving","name_zh":"高效推理与部署","slug":"efficient-inference-and-serving"}],"updates":[]}